  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "商业活动上的偶遇  (Wen Simo Seeks Out Chun Yuqiao's Past)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Shaken by Xin Huimei's feelings for Chun Yuqiao, Wen Simo suddenly agrees to attend a commercial gala so he can meet Luo Lin onstage and ask about Chun Yuqiao's past. Listen to the final scene of Episode 8 first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天晚上的商业活动，我可以过去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "好的，闻老师，您不是一向不感兴趣的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "是，活动上有一个人，我想了想还是见一见吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "别开我玩笑了，我可称不上什么天后。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "您的好朋友惠美才是吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你不也是她的好朋友吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "当初淳于乔欺负你的时候，还是惠美帮你出了头呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "两家卫视打得跟仇人似的，咱们竟然还能同台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "回头咱俩加个微信，我请你喝一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我有家很不错的会所可以介绍给你，那边的红酒还不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你能不能跟我说说，淳于乔这个人呢？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天晚上的商业活动，我可以过去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That commercial event tonight—I can go after all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "好的，闻老师，您不是一向不感兴趣的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, Mr Wen Simo—were you not always uninterested in events like that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "是，活动上有一个人，我想了想还是见一见吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, yet there is someone at the event whom on second thought I ought to meet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "别开我玩笑了，我可称不上什么天后。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop teasing me—I could hardly claim a diva title.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "您的好朋友惠美才是吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your close friend Huimei is the true diva, is she not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你不也是她的好朋友吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Were you not her close friend as well?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "当初淳于乔欺负你的时候，还是惠美帮你出了头呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Back when Chun Yuqiao wronged you, Huimei was the one who stood up for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "两家卫视打得跟仇人似的，咱们竟然还能同台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our two networks fight like sworn enemies, yet here we are sharing a stage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "回头咱俩加个微信，我请你喝一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us add each other on WeChat later, and I will buy you a drink.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我有家很不错的会所可以介绍给你，那边的红酒还不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know a very nice private club I can introduce to you; their red wine is quite good.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你能不能跟我说说，淳于乔这个人呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could you tell me all about what kind of man Chun Yuqiao really is?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天晚上的商业活动，我可以过去。",
      "gap": 0.5
